  "limitations": [
    "The fixture builds each untrusted chain before the driver starts. It does not race a concurrent rename, because the corrected driver has no separate check and read to race.",
    "The unit field check is a shape check, not a live service invocation check. Exclusive ownership and creation fencing remain distinct claims.",
    "No native service manager, real Docker daemon, or disposable runner executed this cycle. The native launcher does not write the record yet.",
    "Private Docker containment, storage durability, deadline and reserve bounds, hosted enforcement, maintainer ratification, and acceptance remain pending."
  ]
